 Advanced Threat Intelligence Collection
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Collect threat intelligence data from multiple sources using Python
Normalize and standardize threat indicators from different formats
Implement data validation for IPs, domains, and file hashes
Calculate risk scores based on multiple threat factors
Generate automated threat intelligence reports
Build a complete threat intelligence pipeline
Prerequisites
Students should have:

Basic Python programming knowledge (functions, loops, dictionaries)
Understanding of cybersecurity concepts and threat indicators
Familiarity with JSON data format
Basic Linux command line skills
Lab Environment
Al Nafi provides pre-configured Ubuntu 22.04 LTS cloud machines. Click Start Lab to access your environment with:

Python 3.10 pre-installed
Required libraries (requests, pandas, json)
Sample threat data files
