Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Import errors for required modules

Solution: Install missing packages with pip3 install <package_name>
Verify installation: python3 -c "import <module>"
Issue: File not found errors

Solution: Ensure you're in the correct directory (~/threat_intel)
Check file paths in configuration files
Verify data files exist before processing
Issue: JSON parsing errors

Solution: Validate JSON syntax using python3 -m json.tool <file>
Check for trailing commas or missing brackets
Ensure proper UTF-8 encoding
Issue: Empty or missing output files

Solution: Check logs directory for error messages
Verify write permissions on output directories
Ensure data collection completed successfully before normalization
